 "fin_note": "<b>With vs. without philanthropy:</b> stripped of grants, the consolidated operating result (EBITDA) is a <b>loss of $303,648 in July / $1.25M YTD</b> &mdash; but that loss <b>beat forecast</b> (July by $133K, YTD by $827K) and <b>narrowed ~50% YoY</b> (from &minus;$2.53M). Adding philanthropy ($851K July / $2.41M YTD) flips it to a <b>positive adjusted net income of $547,552 (July) and $1,152,837 (YTD)</b>. Revenue is &minus;6.2% (mo) / &minus;10.6% (YTD) vs prior year, but expenses fall even faster (&minus;13.0% mo / &minus;17.3% YTD), which is what narrows the loss. *Adjusted net income excludes future pledges, grant-covered start-up costs, interest income, and depreciation.",
 "fin_revmix_note": "<b>The one growing line:</b> digital circulation revenue is <i>up</i> 5.3% YTD (and +23% in July) &mdash; every print line and digital advertising are down double digits. Digital subscriptions are the only organic revenue engine currently growing.",
